data: {"event":"node_finished","conversation_id":"7d023162-0ec5-4c2d-bce3-ba7b310893d7","message_id":"c9bb2292-3490-4d98-86d4-91e377e24bce","created_at":1793579629,"task_id":"145b6c30-9a5e-45be-a94d-04e992cb379e","workflow_run_id":"026b7718-efba-4b71-9ed5-8b0236e0fb4d","data":{"id":"10ea9c00-aae4-4ce8-aa5c-5df3e390ebd0","node_id":"answer","node_type":"answer","title":"酒馆现场","index":11,"predecessor_node_id":null,"inputs":{},"inputs_truncated":false,"process_data":{},"process_data_truncated":false,"outputs":{"answer":"🍺 老周把抹布往肩上一搭：\n\n老周冷笑一声，把那瓶假酒拎起来晃了晃，然后往地上一摔，酒瓶摔得粉碎。'上次你这招可真新，' 老周盯着玩家，眼神里满是恶意，'不过这次我早有准备。'\n\n─────\n😤 怒气值：8/100（本次 +2）\n🏷️ 判定：记仇｜老周状态：擀面杖\n🧠 PowerContext 翻出旧账：2 笔\n📖 seekdb 图鉴：prank_compendium.md\n\n📜 旧账摘录\n· 玩家把假蟑螂塞进老周的杯垫底下，老周早有准备，记仇+3（怒气 +3）\n· 玩家往老周的啤酒里加了大半瓶辣椒水，老周喝了一口后愤怒地盯着玩家，怒气+3。","files":[]},"outputs_truncated":false,"status":"succeeded","error":null,"elapsed_time":0.000114,"execution_metadata":null,"created_at":1793579631,"finished_at":1793579631,"files":[],"iteration_id":null,"loop_id":null}}

